WEBVTT

01:40.001 --> 01:41.421
Hurry up!

01:42.301 --> 01:43.521
Don't rush me.

01:43.521 --> 01:46.061
Let's play a round, then.

01:43.521 --> 01:46.061
We haven't got all day.

01:55.981 --> 01:57.791
This can't be happening!

01:59.721 --> 02:02.621
Face it: You're just a terrible player.

02:03.021 --> 02:06.421
You can't possibly get one 
good hand after another!

02:06.421 --> 02:07.671
Hey.

02:07.971 --> 02:12.551
If you're done, get lost. 
I want to play a round too.

02:12.551 --> 02:13.371
What?

02:16.471 --> 02:18.871
Tsk, what a rotten day.

02:19.151 --> 02:21.751
Hm? I've never seen you here before.

02:21.751 --> 02:23.541
Then let's get to know each other now.

02:24.841 --> 02:25.871
Sit down.

02:29.301 --> 02:30.121
Straight flush.

02:30.571 --> 02:31.851
Four of a kind.

02:31.851 --> 02:33.011
Three aces.

02:34.131 --> 02:36.371
Royal flush.

02:36.371 --> 02:39.711
I-Impossible. How can this be?

02:47.481 --> 02:50.211
"Lucky Coin Blessed 
by the Goddess of Fortune."

02:50.571 --> 02:54.711
It was tossed into a wishing well 
and became a relic.

02:54.971 --> 02:56.971
H-H-How did you?

02:56.971 --> 03:00.221
So that's how you've been 
producing your good hands, huh?

03:00.221 --> 03:02.211
Even so, it's only Rank C,

03:03.051 --> 03:07.121
while you're all being enveloped 
in Rank SS Bankruptcy Aura.

03:09.741 --> 03:11.121
Am I doing this right?!

03:12.571 --> 03:14.121
Ms. Holton!

03:14.721 --> 03:17.121
<i>She's gotten much better 
at controlling the relic.</i>

03:18.151 --> 03:21.711
<i>Now that everyone except Jaeha 
and me is plagued by bad luck,</i>

03:22.001 --> 03:24.961
<i>all the good cards can 
only end up with me.</i>

03:26.871 --> 03:28.371
Take it and get lost.

03:28.371 --> 03:29.501
That's not enough.

03:29.501 --> 03:31.421
What? This is exactly...

03:31.421 --> 03:33.881
And what about your 
punishment for cheating?

03:33.881 --> 03:35.871
One million dollars per person.

03:36.801 --> 03:39.081
Oh, come on! You can't just...

03:42.321 --> 03:46.621
You didn't think you'd get 
away scot-free, did you?

03:47.121 --> 03:50.831
Generous as I am, I'll accept 
forms of payment other than cash.

03:51.551 --> 03:55.041
Give me Xu Fu's relic, 
the one used to lure the children.

03:55.571 --> 03:56.831
What?!

03:56.831 --> 04:01.921
Then tell me exactly 
what Kiera is doing here.

04:01.921 --> 04:03.081
You miserable bastard...

04:03.401 --> 04:06.371
So you approached us on purpose.

04:06.651 --> 04:08.711
You won't get a single wor...

04:12.471 --> 04:14.151
What's wrong, Mary?!

04:19.901 --> 04:21.831
<i>Oh? Could this be...?</i>

04:24.401 --> 04:25.801
M-Ms. Holton!

04:26.201 --> 04:27.581
Someone's screaming!

04:30.601 --> 04:31.831
Ms. Holton...

04:34.331 --> 04:35.691
I'll talk!!

04:35.691 --> 04:38.711
I'll tell you everything, so make it stop!

04:38.711 --> 04:42.201
<i>Well, look at that. It's working 
better than I expected.</i>

04:42.201 --> 04:44.471
Why didn't you say so sooner? 
I'm all ears.

04:44.471 --> 04:48.211
To the north! There's a tomb 
in the forest to the north!

04:48.581 --> 04:53.551
Xu Fu's relic is... there... too...

04:54.821 --> 04:56.541
Hurry, it's about Ms. Holton!

04:56.541 --> 04:57.521
What?

05:03.081 --> 05:05.821
Where are you, Irene? Answer me!

05:08.171 --> 05:12.581
<i>Damn it, where did she go? 
This has to be the relic's risk.</i>

05:12.581 --> 05:16.871
<i>I shouldn't have given Irene 
such a difficult task.</i>

05:19.921 --> 05:22.971
<i>Running around blindly 
won't get me anywhere.</i>

05:22.971 --> 05:25.171
<i>Focus.</i>

05:25.171 --> 05:28.341
<i>I only need to track 
the aura of Irene's relic.</i>

05:39.871 --> 05:41.081
<i>Found her!</i>

05:41.401 --> 05:43.641
<i>Over there? Then she must be close!</i>

05:56.171 --> 06:00.021
Instead of going back 
to the hotel, she came here...?

06:12.851 --> 06:14.581
Mmm, Jooheon...

06:15.251 --> 06:16.751
Oh?

06:18.621 --> 06:21.251
It really is you...

06:21.721 --> 06:22.771
You must have...

06:24.751 --> 06:26.331
W-What are you doing, Irene?

06:34.021 --> 06:37.171
<i>Is the relic speaking through her again?</i>

07:08.211 --> 07:10.041
THIS TIME SHE WAS CRAVING YOUR LIPS.

07:10.521 --> 07:12.541
As if I hadn't noticed that myself!

07:12.541 --> 07:16.621
You were supposed to warn me beforehand,
you feathered bastard!

07:20.521 --> 07:22.621
Hm? A Holton private jet?

07:22.621 --> 07:27.671
It appears he's working 
with someone from the family.

07:28.151 --> 07:31.171
The private jet is 
currently headed for Ghana.

07:31.471 --> 07:33.501
The Holtons and Ghana...

07:34.001 --> 07:35.671
Well, well.

07:46.001 --> 07:48.251
WARNING
YOU ARE ENTERING AN AREA ACCESSIBLE ONLY TO CHILDREN.

07:48.251 --> 07:50.851
<i>Only children are allowed in...</i>

07:50.851 --> 07:53.791
<i>So Xu Fu's relic really is here.</i>

07:53.791 --> 07:57.501
THIS TOMB HAS BEEN CONQUERED.
THE RELIC ALREADY HAS AN OWNER.

07:57.501 --> 08:01.801
<i>Then why wasn't the tomb sealed?</i>

08:01.801 --> 08:03.461
<i>What is Kiera planning?</i>

08:04.421 --> 08:06.461
Give me a few weak relics.

08:06.921 --> 08:10.001
Hm? Relics? You're not going to...?

08:11.501 --> 08:15.021
Ouch! What are you doing, human?!

08:21.721 --> 08:24.101
Ugh, that hurt.

08:24.101 --> 08:25.881
Can't we use the normal entrance for once?

08:25.881 --> 08:29.171
You need a hundred lives 
just to survive next to you!

08:31.171 --> 08:34.671
THIS TOMB HAS BEEN CONQUERED BY HUMANS.
HUMAN ITEMS CAN THEREFORE BE USED.

08:36.451 --> 08:37.671
Well, I'll be.

08:38.301 --> 08:39.501
I even have service.

08:39.501 --> 08:40.671
B-Boss.

08:41.751 --> 08:43.321
Look...

08:48.251 --> 08:49.681
Such a huge field underground.

08:49.681 --> 08:53.371
And nothing but children 
working everywhere.

08:53.371 --> 08:58.421
That explosion just now 
didn't even faze them.

08:58.701 --> 09:01.501
Are they under hypnosis?

09:01.851 --> 09:04.211
How very strange.

09:05.001 --> 09:09.371
THESE PEOPLE ARE CONTROLLED BY XU FU'S RELIC.

09:07.711 --> 09:09.371
THEY HARVEST TEA LEAVES AT HIS COMMAND.

09:12.041 --> 09:15.371
THEY HAVE BEEN ENDOWED WITH 
THE STRENGTH OF A MINOTAUR.

09:15.581 --> 09:18.501
 ITS UNFORGETTABLE TASTE
CAN EVEN BRING THE DEAD BACK TO LIFE.

09:18.501 --> 09:21.271
<i>Damn it. Just as I expected...</i>

09:21.271 --> 09:25.751
<i>The Minotaur: a creature with 
a human body and a bull's head.</i>

09:25.751 --> 09:27.501
<i>That can only mean...</i>

09:28.051 --> 09:31.001
This tea field was created 
by the relic of Shennong.

09:31.351 --> 09:33.001
"Shennong"?

09:33.001 --> 09:35.801
As the inventor 
of the first farming tools,

09:35.801 --> 09:38.091
he is said to have taught 
mankind agriculture.

09:38.771 --> 09:42.401
He discovered which plants were 
beneficial and which were poisonous,

09:42.401 --> 09:47.001
and legend says he used tea leaves 
to purge poison from his body.

09:48.371 --> 09:50.601
What about the relic of Xu Fu?

09:51.051 --> 09:53.421
That must be around here somewhere too.

09:53.851 --> 09:57.751
Kiera couldn't have missed 
this tea field either.

09:58.801 --> 10:03.521
She didn't want to destroy it, 
so she left the tomb open.

10:04.371 --> 10:08.501
However, only children can enter it.

10:08.501 --> 10:12.541
So she used Xu Fu's relic to turn 
the local children into workers.

10:13.821 --> 10:18.711
All right! Let's bag two relics today.

10:19.071 --> 10:21.711
J-Jooheon, the children...

10:20.621 --> 10:21.711
Hm?

10:32.421 --> 10:33.461
Jooheon!

10:35.671 --> 10:38.541
The children have gone berserk! 
Tie them up!

10:38.541 --> 10:40.121
Got it!

10:42.671 --> 10:44.581
Let's play!

10:44.581 --> 10:47.041
You're having fun, aren't you?

10:48.061 --> 10:50.221
Phew, we're still alive!

10:50.221 --> 10:51.801
Everything okay over there?

10:51.801 --> 10:53.331
Yes, everything's fine.

10:54.621 --> 10:56.971
<i>There you are, relic.</i>

10:56.971 --> 11:01.021
<i>Giving off that much aura 
makes things pretty easy for me!</i>

11:10.341 --> 11:12.621
Get that off me right now!

11:13.171 --> 11:15.721
Hm? Where's that voice coming from?

11:15.721 --> 11:17.621
Oh, so that's where you were hiding.

11:18.941 --> 11:21.751
H-How the hell did you spot me?

11:21.751 --> 11:24.921
That's exactly why you should 
keep your anger in check.

11:24.921 --> 11:26.621
Damn it!!

11:27.421 --> 11:29.191
What kind of guy are you?!

11:30.621 --> 11:32.991
And what's with these cheap tricks?

11:33.621 --> 11:37.621
Easy now. I won't hurt you, so calm down.

11:38.801 --> 11:39.961
Really?

11:39.961 --> 11:41.871
Really.

11:41.871 --> 11:44.601
How about a deal?

11:44.601 --> 11:47.501
I know how much you love money.

11:47.501 --> 11:50.371
How much do I have to pay to buy you?

11:50.651 --> 11:54.371
Boss, what are you 
negotiating with that relic?

11:55.151 --> 11:59.101
Like Xu Fu's relic, this one 
is an extortion-type relic.

11:59.101 --> 12:02.041
It demands money for its service.

12:02.041 --> 12:03.711
What? Money?!

12:04.021 --> 12:07.371
You're a man 
I can do business with.

12:07.371 --> 12:11.211
But don't get cocky before 
you even know how expensive...

12:11.211 --> 12:12.711
Two million dollars.

12:12.711 --> 12:15.071
What?! T-Two million?!

12:15.071 --> 12:16.711
That much?!

12:16.711 --> 12:19.821
Ah, so much cash! 
And it's definitely real.

12:19.821 --> 12:21.851
But that's not nearly...

12:21.851 --> 12:22.541
Oh?

12:22.541 --> 12:25.711
And here's another two million. 
Do we have a deal?

12:26.891 --> 12:29.551
It's raining money!

12:29.551 --> 12:32.121
Will you work for me now?

12:32.121 --> 12:35.251
Nope! You'll have to do 
much better than that.

12:36.001 --> 12:39.711
My current owner's down payment 
was considerably higher.

12:40.471 --> 12:44.211
<i>How much cash did Kiera 
shove down his throat?</i>

12:45.171 --> 12:48.901
<i>I added my emergency reserve 
and all my jewelry,</i>

12:48.901 --> 12:51.211
<i>and even threw in my watch.</i>

12:51.211 --> 12:52.351
Here you go!

12:51.211 --> 12:53.421
<i>Irene contributed a property too.</i>

12:54.371 --> 12:58.671
Woo-hoo, my new owner 
certainly doesn't hold back!

12:58.121 --> 13:00.541
THE

12:58.621 --> 13:00.541
DEAL

12:59.121 --> 13:00.541
IS

12:59.621 --> 13:00.541
DONE

13:01.121 --> 13:03.041
So? What can I do for you?

13:03.401 --> 13:06.071
Hey, hey, hey! What are you doing?!

13:06.821 --> 13:10.451
You'd better look forward to it! 
You'll be working hard for all that money!

13:10.451 --> 13:11.831
My first command to you:

13:11.831 --> 13:15.821
Have the children pack up all 
the tea leaves and saplings.

13:15.821 --> 13:17.331
Then we're getting out of here.

13:17.331 --> 13:20.771
Huh? Shennong's relic 
won't be happy about that.

13:20.771 --> 13:22.501
I'll worry about that.

13:22.801 --> 13:26.451
All right. That'll cost you 
another seventy grand.

13:26.451 --> 13:28.001
You want even more money?!

13:28.001 --> 13:30.201
What you paid before was 
only the down payment.

13:30.201 --> 13:32.501
Every command costs extra.

13:32.501 --> 13:36.001
You'll get your money when 
we're out of here. Now get moving!

13:36.001 --> 13:40.621
I-I understand, Master! 
Please stop shaking me!

13:41.221 --> 13:42.821
You scoundrels!

13:42.821 --> 13:46.461
How dare you abandon 
my field and try to escape?

13:46.771 --> 13:48.601
<i>There he is at last!</i>

13:48.601 --> 13:52.621
Worm! Lead my people and 
the children to the exit!

13:52.971 --> 13:55.541
You really will pay me later, won't you?

13:55.541 --> 13:59.001
Would you rather I turn you 
into an earthworm shake?

13:59.791 --> 14:03.291
Hee-hee, just kidding. 
I'll show them the shortcut.

14:05.051 --> 14:06.651
Here. You all go on ahead.

14:06.651 --> 14:08.651
A-And what about you?

14:08.651 --> 14:12.871
Don't worry. I'll claim 
Shennong's relic and follow you.

14:13.621 --> 14:15.351
You intend to claim me?

14:23.501 --> 14:24.961
Get lost!

14:26.551 --> 14:28.331
Struggle all you want.

14:28.331 --> 14:32.251
You'll pay for taking my workers from me!

14:32.251 --> 14:35.421
I'll drag you down into 
the deepest depths of hell!

14:38.711 --> 14:40.171
And what now?

14:40.171 --> 14:41.171
Jooheon!

15:03.871 --> 15:05.451
Jooheon!

15:04.301 --> 15:05.451
Boss!

15:07.651 --> 15:09.501
The tremors are getting stronger!

15:09.801 --> 15:11.301
We have to get out of here!

15:28.001 --> 15:29.751
Pretty cowardly of you.

15:29.751 --> 15:34.621
Ha! That's rich, after you ruined 
my field with a cheap trick!

15:34.621 --> 15:37.971
You enticed the worm into betraying me.

15:38.921 --> 15:42.101
<i>So it was disguised as a tea bush.</i>

15:42.901 --> 15:47.721
<i>Shennong was a god, which means 
his relic might be divine too.</i>

15:47.721 --> 15:49.921
<i>If my dominance isn't enough, then...</i>

15:52.291 --> 15:57.421
Oho? You're putting your 
weapon away? Giving up already?

15:57.421 --> 15:59.501
No, I just want to try something.

15:59.501 --> 16:02.501
What are you talking about?

16:02.771 --> 16:06.751
Looks like there's no way out of here.

16:06.751 --> 16:12.471
But perhaps one will open 
if I kill the owner of this tomb.

16:12.751 --> 16:13.751
What?

16:14.151 --> 16:16.971
"The First Ember of Homo erectus."

16:16.971 --> 16:20.251
A Rank D relic I swiped from the CIA.

16:20.851 --> 16:23.751
Y-You're not planning 
to blow yourself up, are you?!

16:23.751 --> 16:27.001
Thanks to your offshoots, 
there's plenty of firewood here.

16:27.001 --> 16:30.621
One spark and everything 
goes up in flames.

16:30.901 --> 16:33.451
If you do that, you idiot, you'll also...

16:33.451 --> 16:36.961
Unfortunately for you, 
I'm pretty hard to kill.

16:37.421 --> 16:39.581
Hand over your power, relic.

16:39.581 --> 16:43.461
Ow, ow, ow! You're going to break me!

16:43.461 --> 16:45.371
You lunatic!

16:46.521 --> 16:48.581
You think I'll let you do that?!

16:53.831 --> 16:55.921
Set everything ablaze!

17:05.871 --> 17:08.211
Take cover! The tomb is collapsing!

17:13.171 --> 17:15.041
O-Oh no!

17:14.021 --> 17:15.041
Boss!

17:20.471 --> 17:22.261
Jooheon...

17:25.601 --> 17:27.451
Goddamn it...

17:35.591 --> 17:37.671
Why the long faces?

17:43.671 --> 17:47.171
And are those tears? Did somebody die?

17:50.271 --> 17:51.541
Jooheon!

17:51.971 --> 17:55.921
I-I thought you were dead, Boss!

17:56.401 --> 17:58.221
Why would I be dead?

17:58.221 --> 18:00.421
I sealed the tomb myself.

18:01.171 --> 18:02.801
Oh, honestly...

18:04.701 --> 18:06.921
What a relief!

18:06.921 --> 18:09.351
Jaeha was so worried.

18:09.351 --> 18:10.171
You bet!

18:10.171 --> 18:13.151
Wait, no! Of course I wasn't worried!

18:13.151 --> 18:15.421
But you are my employer.

18:15.421 --> 18:18.901
If something happens to you, 
I lose my job!

18:18.901 --> 18:21.001
So my concern was purely rational.

18:21.001 --> 18:22.331
That works out nicely.

18:23.551 --> 18:25.771
You were afraid for your job?

18:25.771 --> 18:29.421
Then you'll be glad there's 
more work waiting for you now.

18:29.901 --> 18:33.051
Boss, what... is all this?

18:33.051 --> 18:33.921
You didn't...

18:34.201 --> 18:37.421
Shennong's relic. 
I had to burn that nuisance.

18:37.421 --> 18:39.021
Ouch...

18:37.901 --> 18:41.721
Oh, and the flint relic 
needs to be repaired too.

18:40.221 --> 18:41.721
That hurts...

18:42.651 --> 18:44.321
How am I supposed to do that?!

18:44.321 --> 18:45.371
Excuse me?

18:45.721 --> 18:48.401
So you can't repair them?

18:48.401 --> 18:51.371
Y-Yes, I can! I will! I promise!

18:52.421 --> 18:54.371
<i>Looks like I celebrated too soon.</i>

19:03.671 --> 19:07.771
Ah, wonderful. Simply fantastic.

19:08.151 --> 19:09.871
Yes, that's the spot.

19:09.871 --> 19:12.421
A little more air.

19:10.301 --> 19:14.801
I can't believe life 
has reduced me to a gardener...

19:12.421 --> 19:14.801
Yes, just like that.

19:14.801 --> 19:17.221
No, I'm more like a tree's butler.

19:17.221 --> 19:18.871
When will this end?

19:19.671 --> 19:20.671
Tsk...

19:22.371 --> 19:23.791
JERK JOOHEON SEO

19:25.871 --> 19:27.621
Hello, Boss?

19:27.621 --> 19:30.501
It's been a while. What's up?

19:30.921 --> 19:32.251
New York?

19:32.251 --> 19:36.001
Yes, sure. First thing tomorrow... okay.

19:36.301 --> 19:37.831
Was that the boss?

19:38.921 --> 19:40.551
Pack your things.

19:41.371 --> 19:43.431
We finally get to go out again.

19:45.401 --> 19:46.751
Boss.

19:46.751 --> 19:48.251
Boss!

19:49.171 --> 19:51.221
Boss!

19:53.701 --> 19:55.451
Are we there yet?

19:55.451 --> 19:57.061
I'm sorry.

19:57.061 --> 20:02.171
We're still on the way, but 
I suddenly can't reach my family.

20:02.551 --> 20:06.221
It's one thing that our driver isn't 
answering, but even George won't pick up.

20:06.221 --> 20:07.671
I'm a little worried.

20:09.071 --> 20:12.671
There's no need, Irene. 
We're almost there.

20:12.671 --> 20:15.521
Soon we'll be able to heal your parents.

20:16.171 --> 20:18.171
HEAD GARDENER

20:17.351 --> 20:18.171
Seung-Woo?

20:19.871 --> 20:20.871
What is it?

20:20.871 --> 20:25.171
Boss, we have a problem! 
Some men are after us!

20:25.171 --> 20:26.951
You're being followed?

20:26.151 --> 20:27.671
I think they're after the tree!

20:28.421 --> 20:33.171
<i>It looks like Kiera 
has been investigating me.</i>

20:33.171 --> 20:36.671
We're changing the meeting point. 
Make sure you lose them.

20:36.671 --> 20:41.151
Don't get caught, or I'll kill you myself.

20:41.151 --> 20:42.501
B-But Boss!

20:43.421 --> 20:47.001
Is there a problem with your people?

20:47.601 --> 20:51.071
They'll be fine.

20:51.471 --> 20:53.501
Could you drive a little faster?

20:53.501 --> 20:58.001
Boss, the road is completely jammed.

20:58.701 --> 21:02.471
It's not usually this bad. 
You must really be down on your luck...

21:03.821 --> 21:05.001
Was that an accident?

21:06.571 --> 21:09.671
If anything happens to Jooheon's people,

21:09.671 --> 21:13.171
we'll lose the healing relic, 
and my parents will...

21:14.371 --> 21:17.591
Irene, please calm down!

21:24.701 --> 21:27.651
Mission accomplished, Boss!
